        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jan Kodeš, Margaret Court, Ion Țiriac\n- Events: 1970 French Open\n- Places: Perth, Western Australia\n- Roles: Christian minister, tennis player\n\nFacts:\n- Jan Kodeš won the men's singles title at the 1970 French Open.\n- Margaret Court won the women's singles title at the 1970 French Open.\n- Ion Țiriac won the men's doubles title at the 1970 French Open, which was his only Grand Slam title.\n- Ion Țiriac was a former top 10 tennis player.\n- Margaret Court is currently a Christian minister in Perth, Western Australia.",
